<title>CANADA: George Weston Ltd may buy back shares.</title>
<headline>George Weston Ltd may buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>George Weston Ltd said on Thursday that it intends to purchase up to 2,243,851 of its common shares or five percent of the total outstanding by way of normal course purchases on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The purchases are authorized to start on March 17, 1997 and will end on March 16, 1998, the company said.</p>
<p>All purchases will be made according to the market price of the common shares at the time of acquisition, George Weston said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8104))</p>
</text>
